    "story": {
      "type": "Image-and-video-text",
      "settings": {
        "color_scheme": "scheme-4faf0e4d-27f4-4d02-bc51-617383bab1a9",
        "section_width": "container",
        "image_position": "left",
        "text_column_width": 56,
        "content_align": "left",
        "media_type": "image",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/landing-behind-camera.webp",
        "image_alt": "A camera rig filming an interview in a library",
        "aspect_w": 4,
        "aspect_h": 5,
        "image_fit": "cover",
        "image_radius": 14,
        "padding_top_desktop": 72,
        "padding_bottom_desktop": 72,
        "mobile_order": "media_first"
      },
      "blocks": {
        "heading_1": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "Wait, why pay for this?",
            "tag": "h2",
            "size_desktop": 40
          }
        },
        "heading_2": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "There are free videos everywhere.",
            "tag": "h3",
            "size_desktop": 40,
            "enable_custom_style": true,
            "color": "#ff5f1f"
          }
        },
        "subheading_3": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>There are, and I learned from them too. The trouble is they teach one trick at a time, on footage you do not have.</p><p>Here every lesson comes with the clips, in an order that builds. You cut along, then bring your edit to a call where I tell you what to change. That is the part a free video cannot do.</p>"
          }
        },
        "eyebrow_4": {
          "type": "eyebrow",
          "settings": {
            "text": "Your name, editor and teacher"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_1",
        "heading_2",
        "subheading_3",
        "eyebrow_4"
      ]
    },
